      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! C’est toi qui as gagné le Nari-Quiz, non ?\nQuel plaisir de te croiser ici !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je peux te parler de mon projet ? En tant qu’ami<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nNaricker, je pense que tu comprendras ma vision !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai plusieurs Lampéroie, et je compte faire\névoluer l’un d’entre eux en Ohmassacre pour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navoir le même Pokémon partenaire que Narica !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais d’abord, je dois déterminer lequel mérite\nle plus de recevoir une Pierre Foudre pour évoluer.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et pour m’aider à trancher, je n’aurais pu rêver\nmieux que l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿਉe gagnanta gagnante du Nari-Quiz en personne !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’il te plaît, bats-toi contre mes Lampéroie !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa m’aidera à voir lequel d’entre eux se débrouille\nle mieux en combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir si tu veux bien te battre\ncontre mes Lampéroie.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F00690072002000730069002000740075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E0020007400650020006200610074007400720065000A0063006F006E0074007200650020006D006500730020004C0061006D007000E90072006F00690065002E00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien te battre contre mes Lampéroie ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa m’aidera à voir lequel d’entre eux se débrouille\nle mieux en combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec plaisir !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100760065006300200070006C00610069007300690072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas maintenant.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100730020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, OK... Reviens me voir quand ça sera\nle bon moment, alors !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020004F004B002E002E002E002000520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F006900720020007100750061006E0064002000E7006100200073006500720061000A006C006500200062006F006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074002C00200061006C006F007200730020002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci ! Seul<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Naricker de ton calibre peut\nm’aider à choisir le meilleur Lampéroie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non, on est en pleine zone de combat...\nRemettons ça à plus tard !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F006E002C0020006F006E002000650073007400200065006E00200070006C00650069006E00650020007A006F006E006500200064006500200063006F006D006200610074002E002E002E000A00520065006D006500740074006F006E0073002000E70061002000E000200070006C00750073002000740061007200640020002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce n’est pas pour rien que tu as gagné\nle Nari-Quiz ! Tu es vraiment très doué<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même si on a perdu, j’ai quand même réussi\nà réunir assez de données pour déterminer lequel<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde mes Lampéroie mérite une Pierre Foudre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Angus ! Tu n’as vraiment rien compris !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006700750073002000210020005400750020006E20190061007300200076007200610069006D0065006E00740020007200690065006E00200063006F006D00700072006900730020002100100002011400350000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M’sieur Stéfan ! Que voulez-vous dire ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D20190073006900650075007200200053007400E900660061006E00200021002000510075006500200076006F0075006C0065007A002D0076006F00750073002000640069007200650020003F00100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’Ohmassacre de notre Narica adorée n’a pas\nété choisi pour sa force... au contraire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était un faible Lampéroie qu’elle a entraîné\njusqu’à en faire le plus puissant des Ohmassacre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouah !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŅ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500610068002000210021002100100002011401450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oie... !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00690065002E002E002E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu comprends, maintenant ? Un vrai Naricker sait\napprécier tous ses Lampéroie à leur juste valeur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "M<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿᄏon vieil ennemia vieille ennemie ! Merci d’avoir accepté\nde te battre contre notre jeune recrue.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, suis-moi, Angus ! On retourne au QG des\nDigi-Z4P pour continuer ta formation de Naricker !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ5",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
